<title>FRANCE: Block trades - Publicis 177,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Block trades - Publicis 177,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two block share trades in French advertising group Publicis were traded on Friday at 1120 GMT and 1137 GMT at 435 francs and 440 francs per share respectively, brokers said.</p>
<p>The first trade was for 100,000 shares and the second for 77,000, together representing 2.2 percent of Publicis' capital.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
